      "text": [
        "Tattoos built tolast a lifetime.",
        "Black Anchor Tattoo is a private-studio collective on Sydney Street, working exclusively in custom design across fine line, blackwork, and traditional styles. No flash off the wall — every piece is drawn for the skin it's going on.",
        "Custom Tattoo Studio · North Laine, Brighton"
      ]
    },
