      "text": [
        "What People Say",
        "\"Marcus took a rough idea I'd had for years and turned it into a full sleeve I actually love. The studio itself feels calm and unhurried — a world away from the tourist shops on the seafront.\"",
        "\"Isla did a fine line piece on my forearm and it's healed beautifully. She was honest about what would and wouldn't age well, which I really appreciated.\"",
        "\"Got a cover-up from Ronan after a bad experience elsewhere. He talked me through exactly what was possible before touching the machine. Couldn't be happier.\""
      ]
    },
