      "text": [
        "Frequently Asked",
        "We're appointment-only for custom work, but we hold a small amount of walk-in flash availability on Saturdays — call ahead to check the day's slots.",
        "We charge a day rate of £450 for larger pieces, or a minimum charge of £90 for small work. Your artist will quote a firm price once the design is finalised.",
        "Yes, a £50 non-refundable deposit secures your appointment and is deducted from the final price on the day. This covers design time.",
        "In line with UK law, we only tattoo clients aged 18 and over. Valid photo ID is required at every first appointment.",
        "You'll leave with a printed aftercare sheet and a starter supply of healing balm. In short: keep it clean, keep it moisturised, and stay out of the sun and sea for at least two weeks."
      ]
    },
